 attention to the placement of the highest quality man-made materials. <EOL><br><br> <EOL>When you hold these wonderfully ""life-like"" animals, you will see and feel HANSA's emphasis on quality, which is a result of careful attention to design, custom fabric selection, cutting, sewing, stuffing, eye placement, feature creation, framing, air brushing and finishing. Since each animal is hand sewn, there will be slight variations in appearance.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,75,35,30,1000,Y,51941,Hansa Toys USA/Bear,,1441.900,,Thursday 06 June 2013 10:08:27 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,1624,4806021940426,769.950,41,N,196,Hansa Toys USA
